   "textLength": 347,
   "text": "The React Foundation has eight Platinum founding members: Amazon, Callstack, Expo, Huawei, Meta, Microsoft, Software Mansion, and Vercel. Huawei has joined since our announcement in October. The React Foundation will be governed by a board of directors composed of representatives from each member, with Seth Webster serving as executive director.",
